(text "Notes" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 327.66 18.542 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a3ae1b8d-b6f1-459f-9ad7-e2f918406a82"))
(text "Regenerated from the baseline netlist (tag baseline-2026-11-23-locked) with\nthe Phase 2 pin re-use: PC10/PC11/PC12 = SPI3 SCK/MISO/MOSI (AF6) slot bus,\nSCK/MOSI through 33R source resistors; PE0/PE1/PD11 = slot CS decoder A0-A2,\nPD13 = decoder enable (100k pull-down = no slot selected); PC9 = SLOT_RST_N\nvia 33R (100k pull-down = slots held in reset, also forces GLOBAL_OUT_ALLOW\nlow); PB4 = SLOT_EXP_INT_N; PB5 = ID_MUX_RST_N (10k pull-up on the backplane:\nmuxes run at MCU reset, pulse low to recover a stuck ID bus); PB6 =\nID_WP_UNLOCK (100k pull-down, drives the ID_WP FET); PB7 = RC_ALLOW (100k\npull-down: rail cut off until firmware allows it); PB10/PB11 = I2C2 SCL/SDA\n(AF4, DS12110 rev 10) for the slot ID bus; PC1 (pin 16, ADC123_INP11; was\nMUXB_OUT) = SLOT_ANA; PE13 = SLOT_ANA_EN (U109 EN, 100k pull-down); MUX_A0-2\n100k pull-downs. Baseline sheet notes: docs/modular/mainboard_sheet_notes.md.\nPass 6 M3: the engine-slot lines that reached U7 directly now pass a series\nresistor at the MCU: DPLUS_SNS 1k (after the D65 clamp), FUEL_ISNS /\nCRANK_ISNS / MPU_GATE / MPU_SPEED / DPLUS_EXC_EN / DIAG_EN 10k 0805 with a\nBAT54S clamp to +3V3_SAFE/GND on the MCU side (36 V card fault -> <= 3.3 mA);\nISNS lines add 1 nF (tau 10 us, ADC sample time >= 64.5 cycles, FW_REQ C8).\nMath: docs/modular/pass6_fix_calc.txt." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 328.93 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a54b8e00-3ddb-407a-8ca3-3a444c7691e2"))
(embedded_fonts no))
